        `Model.dual_of(variable)` — the dual (residual) variable conjugate to a
        primal `variable` (e.g. `"u_x" -> "f_x"`, `"T" -> "q"`), searched across
        all sub-models, or `None`. A helper to fill an MPC term's `target_dual`.
